Unify the single-source and multi-source loading paths through a single `MergeConfig` (removes `prepare_single_source`); split `_do_load_multi` into `_run_merge` + `_validate_merged` for readability; move all env-dependent setup out of `Loader.__init__` into `_prepare_for_load` called on each `.load()`; extract `_make_retort_key` helper and replace `_get_validation_loader` (id-based memoization) with a straightforward `_build_validation_loader`.
